377
00:23:51.440 --> 00:23:52.950
When you need to send your location,

378
00:23:53.180 --> 00:23:55.650
Quickler can add the address
and the weather for you.

379
00:23:55.900 --> 00:23:58.300
The faults that you pick
up as you go round the site

380
00:23:58.300 --> 00:24:01.230
