to-do list on Quickler.

381
00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:04.650
When a site manager receives
the report from you,

382
00:24:04.660 --> 00:24:07.670
they'll be able to copy the actions
straight into their own system.

383
00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:11.940
Every inspection is kept with
the whole chat and every photo

384
00:24:11.940 --> 00:24:16.270
in case anyone ever asks
what was done on the day.

385
00:24:16.880 --> 00:24:19.340
Care homes require lots of regular checks

386
00:24:19.340 --> 00:24:22.610
of their rooms, the fire doors,
the kitchens and the equipment.

387
00:24:22.860 --> 00:24:25.240
With Quickler, your staff
can do them in WhatsApp

388
00:24:25.240 --> 00:24:28.390
with a voice note or
photos as they go round.

389
00:24:28.580 --> 00:24:32.430
Quickler writes the record and
puts every fault in a to-do list.

390
00:24:32.640 --> 00:24:35.680
You can schedule the checks
for the days that you need

391
00:24:35.680 --> 00:24:37.640
and if one is missed, you'll be notified.

392
00:24:37.640 --> 00:24:41.340
So, when an inspector asks,
you have every record available

393
00:24:41.340 --> 00:24:44.210
with photos, dates and who did it.

394
00:24:44.840 --> 00:24:47.590
A fire risk assessment
usually means a lot of notes,

395
00:24:47.820 --> 00:24:50.050
a lot of photos and a long write-up.

396
00:24:50.240 --> 00:24:53.150
With Quickler, you can
walk the building and talk,

397
00:24:53.180 --> 00:24:54.590
sending photos as you go.

398
00:24:54.760 --> 00:24:56.420
Each photo lands in the right question

399
00:24:56.420 --> 00:24:58.870
and every fault goes on the to-do list.

400
00:24:59.020 --> 00:25:01.320
Your report comes back in your own layout

401
00:25:01.320 --> 00:25:03.710
with your own standard
wording where it belongs.

402
00:25:04.640 --> 00:25:07.420
Everything for your account
